# Lets the active session read the keyboards cosmic-voice takes its trigger
# from. systemd's stock rules put the logind `uaccess` ACL on joysticks only,
# so without this an ordinary keyboard is root:input 0660 and the watcher sees
# nothing.
#
# Keep this to the boards that carry the trigger. A uaccess tag lets every
# process in the session read every key on that device, which is the thing the
# EVIOCSMASK filter in hotkey.rs exists to avoid. Add a line per keyboard,
# matched on the attributes `udevadm info -a /dev/input/eventN` prints.
#
# Must sort before 73-seat-late.rules, which applies the tag.

# ASUS ROG Zephyrus G15 (GA503) internal keyboard: the M1-M4 keys live here.
SUBSYSTEM=="input", KERNEL=="event*", ATTRS{id/vendor}=="0b05", ATTRS{id/product}=="19b6", TAG+="uaccess"
